%%{init: {"fontSize": 14, "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 24, "messageMargin": 30, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 140, "wrap": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
        participant FD as Front Door<br>trade-imports-<br>ins-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    Note over B,SS: John's last page load refreshed<br>the session, then he left his desk
    Note over B,SS: The idle point passes,<br>nothing runs or is written
    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>bookmark, session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /notifications/123<br>X-Forwarded-Prefix: /gbn-ag,<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    JF->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: lastSeenAt more than<br>30 minutes old,<br>left unchanged
    SS-->>JF: 410 idle
    Note over JF: Return path built
    JF-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123
    B->>RS: GET /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>old session cookie
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>old session cookie
    Note over FD: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    FD->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    SS-->>FD: 410 idle
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins<br>provider IDM, mode sign-in,<br>return path
    Note over SS: Round trip stored
    SS-->>FD: 201 Created<br>IDM address, binding value
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: IDM authorize endpoint<br>Set-Cookie: binding cookie
    B->>IDM: GET IDM authorize endpoint<br>?client_id, redirect_uri,<br>scope=openid {serviceId} offline_access,<br>state, nonce, code_challenge
    Note over IDM: IDM session lapsed
    alt John signed in through Government Gateway
        Note over B,IDM: Provider session still live, not asked for credentials
    else John signed in through GOV.UK One Login
        Note over B,IDM: Provider session lapsed, asked for credentials
    end
    IDM-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/callback<br>?code=…&state=…
    B->>RS: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie
    RS->>FD: GET /auth/callback?code=…&state=…<br>binding cookie
    FD->>SS: POST /sign-ins/{state}/completion<br>code, binding value
    Note over SS: Round trip consumed,<br>binding value checked
    SS->>IDM: POST IDM token endpoint<br>grant_type=authorization_code,<br>via CDP's outbound proxy
    IDM-->>SS: 200 new tokens
    Note over SS: New record,<br>new sessionId
    SS-->>FD: 201 Created<br>sealed cookie value,<br>return path
    Note over FD: New session cookie set
    FD-->>B: 302 Location: /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>Set-Cookie: __Host-ins-session
    Note over SS: Old record stays in the store:<br>idle, then expired
